LengthOfPipe [SimTalk]
Returns the Length of the Pipe designated by <Path>.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.LengthOfPipe → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
Is the length of the Pipe which you inserted into the Frame by clicking the left mouse button to set its first
and its last point.
Example
print Pipe1.LengthOfPipe
